        "The court of appeal’s judgment of 7 December 2016"^^xsd:string,
        "court of appeal’s judgment of 7 December 2016"^^xsd:string,
        "the Brussels Court of Appeal’s judgment of 7 December 2016 ordering the Belgian State to execute the Aliens Appeals Board’s judgment of 20 October 2016"^^xsd:string .

